{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c09d29dd0bc8cb90","name":"MerenData","source":{"id":"source:reference-c09d29dd0bc8cb90","title":"MerenData","revision":24506,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:46:10Z","sha256":"ad45e8c3621d1696acb8e9dfb6be7955d3b0926d1b694aa30ad74a2348a1cbc0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24506","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=MerenData&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c09d29dd0bc8cb90","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Manufacturer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Manufacturer"}," to benefit from the rise of the Empire, MerenData supplies Security, Espionage, and Interrogation Droids to the Imperial military and government agencies. MerenData also produces commercial units, competing with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybot Galactica"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybot_Galactica","referenceId":"reference:8d89ff519236e3e2"},". Although it is not a dominant player, MerenData's reliable designs and the company's centuries-long history make it a worthy competitor. MerenData's support of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," makes sales to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}," initially impossible and undesirable. However, as Imperial influence shrinks, so does MerenData's opposition to doing business with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"},"- aided by the ousting of company officials tied to the Empire. MerenData is also a major contributor to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufacturer Traits:"]}," MerenData Droids are known for their intimidating personalities. When making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"},", a MerenData Droid adds its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," bonus to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},". When attempting to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", it adds both its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," bonus and its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," bonus to the check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
